  "cHow": {
   "fill": "blue",
   "page": "clean",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Agent V, new direction: every screen\n\n• One modern typeface (Geist), near-black and warm white, one blue.\n• Main screens: a dark top that says what matters, a light area of a few large rounded blocks.\n• Blue means \"needs you\", and marks the agent itself (microphone, voice, where it points).\n• Red only for what can't be undone.\n\nRows: Every day · Find your work, goals and ideas · You and settings · Getting started · Menus and outside the app.\n\nPress Play on Today, or on Welcome to go through getting started.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": -640,
   "y": 0
  },
  "cTitle": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 4620,
   "page": "clean",
   "text": "Every day",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -300
  },
  "cYou": {
   "kind": "title1",
