   "y": 944
  },
  "howto": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "How you move around\n\n• A floating toolbar on the main screens: Home, Jobs, Search, and + to ask.\n• You (settings) opens from your initial at the top of Home.\n• Approvals and questions open as sheets over whatever you are looking at, so you never lose your place.\n• Every notification opens exactly the thing it is about.\n• Anything can be shared into Agent V from another app (a link, file or photo) and becomes a new job.\n\nPress Play on a screen to click through. Sample names and content are illustrative. Colours and type are a first direction; the design system is settled in stage 5.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": -640,
   "y": 0
  },
  "lEveryday": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 4620,
   "page": "ledger",
   "text": "Every day",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -300
  },
  "lFind": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 860,
   "page": "ledger",
   "text": "Find your work",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 944
  },
  "lHow": {
   "fill": "blue",
   "page": "ledger",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Ledger: how it works\n\n• No tab bar. \"Hand something off…\" is always at the bottom of Today and Jobs: handing off work is the main action.\n• The masthead: AGENT V goes back to Today; search, jobs and your initial sit on the right.\n• Everything waiting on you is numbered and shown one at a time (1 of 3, 2 of 3…).\n• Approvals are signatures. Press and hold to sign: deliberate, but one gesture. Things that can't be undone use deep red and add Face ID.\n• Blue only ever means \"waiting on you\".\n\nPress Play and try holding the Sign button on \"For your signature\".",
   "w": 520,
   "x": -640,
   "y": 0
  },
  "lStart": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 860,
   "page": "ledger",
   "text": "Getting started",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2188
  },
  "lYou": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 1330,
   "page": "ledger",
   "text": "You and settings",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 944
  },
  "sFix": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 2270,
   "page": "states",
   "text": "When a job needs you to step in or fix something",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 944
  },
  "sHow": {
   "fill": "blue",
   "page": "states",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Stage 4: every screen in detail\n\n• Loading: what the phone last knew, at once; grey shapes only when nothing is stored yet.\n• Empty: first time shows what will be here and a way to start; all clear shows what's coming up.\n• Errors stay in the block that failed, in plain words, with Try again. Never red.\n• Offline: an Offline chip and \"as of\" times; new hand-offs wait on the phone; signing needs a connection.\n\nSecond row: the stage 3 moments that had no screen yet.\nThird row: layouts that part 2 (screen by screen) needed.\n\nEvery other state follows these patterns and is described in docs/design/04-screens.md.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": -640,
